ms"><label><input type="checkbox" data-k="kt1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3h6v4H9zM8 7h8v14H8z"/></svg><b>Répulsif</b><span>pour la peau, efficace en zone tropicale</span></label></li><li class="op-rv" style="--d:120ms"><label><input type="checkbox" data-k="kt2"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7a3.5 3.5 0 015 5L12 22a3.5 3.5 0 01-5-5z"/></svg><b>Antipaludique</b><span>prescrit par votre médecin</span></label></li><li class="op-rv" style="--d:180ms"><label><input type="checkbox" data-k="kt3"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 2h4v4h-4zM8 6h8l1 16H7z"/></svg><b>Gel hydroalcoolique</b><span>pour les marchés et les trajets</span></label></li><li class="op-rv" style="--d:240ms"><label><input type="checkbox" data-k="kt4"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v2M12 19v2M4 12H2M22 12h-2M5.6 5.6l1.4 1.4M17 17l1.4 1.4M5.6 18.4L7 17M17 7l1.4-1.4M12 8a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8z"/></svg><b>Crème solaire</b><span>indice élevé, chapeau, lunettes</span></label></li><li class="op-rv" style="--d:300ms"><label><input type="checkbox" data-k="kt5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3h12l-2 18H8z"/></svg><b>Sels de réhydratation</b><span>en cas de forte chaleur ou de troubles</span></label></li><li class="op-rv" style="--d:360ms"><label><input type="checkbox" data-k="kt6"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 9h16v6H4zM9 4h6v16H9z"/></svg><b>Pansements, désinfectant</b><span>la petite trousse de base</span></label></li><li class="op-rv" style="--d:420ms"><label><input type="checkbox" data-k="kt7"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2h9l3 3v17H6zM9 12h6M9 16h6"/></svg><b>Ordonnances</b><span>et traitements habituels en quantité suffisante</span></label></li></ul><p class="tr-n" id="trN"></p><div class="tr-tl op-rv"><div><b>6 semaines</b><span>avant : consultation au centre de vaccinations internationales.</span></div><div><b>10 jours</b><span>avant au plus tard : vaccin contre la fièvre jaune.</span></div><div><b>Sur place</b><span>eau en bouteille capsulée, répulsif dès le coucher du soleil.</span></div></div></div></section><script>(function(){var b=document.querySelectorAll(".tr input[data-k]"),n=document.getElementById("trN");function u(){var c=0;b.forEach(function(i){if(i.checked)c++});n.textContent=c+" / "+b.length+" dans la trousse"+(c===b.length?" : vous êtes prêt !":"")}b.forEach(function(i){try{i.checked=localStorage.getItem("ba-"+i.dataset.k)==="1"}catch(e){}i.addEventListener("change",function(){try{localStorage.setItem("ba-"+i.dataset.k,i.checked?"1":"0")}catch(e){}u()})});u()})();</script><script>(function(){function go(){var e=document.querySelectorAll(".op-rv:not(.on)");if(!("IntersectionObserver" in window)){e.forEach(function(x){x.classList.add("on")});return}var o=new IntersectionObserver(function(n){n.forEach(function(x){if(x.isIntersecting){x.target.classList.add("on");o.unobserve(x.target)}})},{threshold:.1});e.forEach(function(x){o.observe(x)})}if(document.readyState==="loading")document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",go);else go()})();</script>

            
                                        
            
            
            
                                        
